	(text "[ ] U9 AVR128DA48 pin map: TWI0 PA2/PA3, USART0 PA0/PA1 (CP2102N), USART1 PC0/PC1 (J10), ADC PD0-PD2,\n     BAND_A PA5 / BAND_B PA6, D4 PA7, SYNC LED PC2, GPS USART3 DEFAULT PB0 TX / PB1 RX; firmware must follow.\n[x] GPS_PPS on PF2 (fully async pin): EVSYS CHANNEL4/5 gen 0x4A -> USERTCB0CAPT (DS 21.5, 16.3.4).\n[ ] BTN_DSP_1 moved PF2 -> PE0; PB2 kept free (async, EVSYS CH0/1) for a future CAL_CLK.\n[ ] Y1: CL 12.5 pF, C41/C42 15p assumes 5 pF pin + ~2 pF stray (XOSC32K LPMODE=0);\n     trim after measuring the 32 kHz error.\n[x] TX LED D12 (KT-0603YG) + R39 470R hang off the TX net (PA4); ~3 mA, no extra MCU pin.\n[x] D10/R35 UPDI diode + 470R identical to Si5351AVFO J5 and EtherKeyerMini J3.\n[ ] Q6/Q7 AO3400A drive the 6-relay tree (Q6 2 coils ~42 mA, Q7 4 coils ~84 mA); Q8/Q9 removed.\n[ ] +5V now from USB-C VBUS only (500 mA default USB); PA draw not yet measured.\n[x] U1 FB tied to VIN: Jason: FB tied to VIN selects internal 12 V output (TLV61046A datasheet)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 133.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0 1.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "06f78ca0-e4cc-459a-b8d0-a1313784ce31")
	)
